   "lines": [
    "Went to \"church\", read",
    "my bible, and spent",
    "the rest of the",
    "day shaving, bathing",
    "and getting things",
    "ready for a new",
    "expedition. I always like",
    "these backwoods meeting",
    "houses; and I don't know",
    "a better or more intelli-",
    "-gent race of men than",
    "these shrewd, plucky,",
    "honest Yankees — all",
    "of them hunters, lum-",
    "-bermen or small",
    "farmers."
   ],
